*Description of changes:*
This PR adds forward ref support for the `Rating` primitive by wrapping it in `React.forwardRef`.

```jsx
const CustomerComponent = () => {
  const ref = React.useRef(null); // ref.current.nodeName will be `DIV`
  
  return (
    <Rating ref={ref}  />
  );
};
```


